{"id":"3adac41d0f340db5","group":"58","path":"58/batch13/58-df-zfc-inner4-hod-of-model.md","title":"ZFC Inner4 Hod Of Model","display":"df-zfc-inner4-hod-of-model — ZFC Inner4 Hod Of Model","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-inner4-hod-of-model","aliases":["58-df-zfc-inner4-hod-of-model"],"display":"df-zfc-inner4-hod-of-model — ZFC Inner4 Hod Of Model","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch10/58-df-zfc-inner2-transitive-model.md]]","[[../batch10/58-df-transitive-closure.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]]","[[../batch07/58-df-free-variable.md]]","[[../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md]]","[[../batch03/58-df-assignment.md]]","[[../batch06/58-df-proper.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-inner4-hod-of-model"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-inner4-hod-of-model</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-inner4-hod-of-model — ZFC Inner4 Hod Of Model"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b8a669eb1f18f3f5\" href=\"?note=b8a669eb1f18f3f5\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-zfc-inner2-transitive-model.md\">../batch10/58-df-zfc-inner2-transitive-model.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"8c8abfb908cc9a24\" href=\"?note=8c8abfb908cc9a24\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-transitive-closure.md\">../batch10/58-df-transitive-closure.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-formula.md\">../batch17/58-df-formula.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"715a32e91161b34f\" href=\"?note=715a32e91161b34f\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-free-variable.md\">../batch07/58-df-free-variable.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"8b6a90316aad78a4\" href=\"?note=8b6a90316aad78a4\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md\">../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"64f35ba2e87964e0\" href=\"?note=64f35ba2e87964e0\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-assignment.md\">../batch03/58-df-assignment.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"8935dcac821c0104\" href=\"?note=8935dcac821c0104\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-proper.md\">../batch06/58-df-proper.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,H\\in V\">\\(M,H\\in V\\)</span> (set-coded model and its HOD part)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcInner2TransitiveModel}_S\\subseteq V\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcInner2TransitiveModel}_S\\subseteq V\\)</span> (transitive-ZFC-model predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"b8a669eb1f18f3f5\" href=\"?note=b8a669eb1f18f3f5\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-zfc-inner2-transitive-model.md\">../batch10/58-df-zfc-inner2-transitive-model.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TC}:V\\to V\">\\(\\mathrm{TC}:V\\to V\\)</span> (transitive-closure operator, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"8c8abfb908cc9a24\" href=\"?note=8c8abfb908cc9a24\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-transitive-closure.md\">../batch10/58-df-transitive-closure.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}_S:V\\to V\">\\(\\mathrm{Fml}_S:V\\to V\\)</span> (formula-set operator, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-formula.md\">../batch17/58-df-formula.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathcal L_\\in}:V\\to V\">\\(\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathcal L_\\in}:V\\to V\\)</span> (free-variable operator, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"715a32e91161b34f\" href=\"?note=715a32e91161b34f\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-free-variable.md\">../batch07/58-df-free-variable.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MembershipStructure}_S(\\mathfrak M,M)\">\\(\\mathrm{MembershipStructure}_S(\\mathfrak M,M)\\)</span> (canonical membership structure, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-14\" data-note=\"8935dcac821c0104\" href=\"?note=8935dcac821c0104\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-proper.md\">../batch06/58-df-proper.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S(\\mathfrak M,\\mathcal L_\\in,\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat})\">\\(\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S(\\mathfrak M,\\mathcal L_\\in,\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat})\\)</span> (typed satisfaction recursion, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-15\" data-note=\"8b6a90316aad78a4\" href=\"?note=8b6a90316aad78a4\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md\">../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Assign}(\\mathfrak M,s)\">\\(\\mathrm{Assign}(\\mathfrak M,s)\\)</span> (assignment predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-16\" data-note=\"64f35ba2e87964e0\" href=\"?note=64f35ba2e87964e0\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-assignment.md\">../batch03/58-df-assignment.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ord}\\subseteq\\mathsf{Class}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ord}\\subseteq\\mathsf{Class}\\)</span> (ordinal class, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-17\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcInner4HodOfModel}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcInner4HodOfModel}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}inner4\\text{-}hod\\text{-}of\\text{-}model}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcInner4HodOfModel}_S(M,H)\\leftrightarrow{}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad \\mathrm{ZfcInner2TransitiveModel}_S(M)\\land H\\subseteq M\n\\land\\exists\\mathfrak M,\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat}\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{MembershipStructure}_S(\\mathfrak M,M)\n\\land\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S(\\mathfrak M,\\mathcal L_\\in,\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat})\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall x\\in M\\;\\Biggl(x\\in H\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall y\\in\\mathrm{TC}(\\{x\\})\\;\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;\n\\exists\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L_\\in)\\;\n\\exists\\bar\\alpha\\in(\\mathrm{Ord}\\cap M)^n\\;\\exists s\\;\\Bigl(\n\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathcal L_\\in}(\\varphi)\\subseteq\\{v_0,\\ldots,v_n\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{28mm}\\land\\mathrm{Assign}(\\mathfrak M,s)\\land s(v_0)=y\n\\land\\forall i\\in n\\;(s(v_{i+1})=\\bar\\alpha(i))\n\\land\\operatorname{Sat}(\\varphi,s)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{28mm}\\land\\forall z\\in M\\;\\forall t\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Assign}(\\mathfrak M,t)\\land t(v_0)=z\n\\land\\forall i\\in n\\;(t(v_{i+1})=\\bar\\alpha(i))\n\\land\\operatorname{Sat}(\\varphi,t)\\to z=y\\Bigr)\\Bigr)\\Biggr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}inner4\\text{-}hod\\text{-}of\\text{-}model}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcInner4HodOfModel}_S(M,H)\\leftrightarrow{}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad \\mathrm{ZfcInner2TransitiveModel}_S(M)\\land H\\subseteq M\n\\land\\exists\\mathfrak M,\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat}\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{MembershipStructure}_S(\\mathfrak M,M)\n\\land\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S(\\mathfrak M,\\mathcal L_\\in,\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat})\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall x\\in M\\;\\Biggl(x\\in H\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall y\\in\\mathrm{TC}(\\{x\\})\\;\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;\n\\exists\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L_\\in)\\;\n\\exists\\bar\\alpha\\in(\\mathrm{Ord}\\cap M)^n\\;\\exists s\\;\\Bigl(\n\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathcal L_\\in}(\\varphi)\\subseteq\\{v_0,\\ldots,v_n\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{28mm}\\land\\mathrm{Assign}(\\mathfrak M,s)\\land s(v_0)=y\n\\land\\forall i\\in n\\;(s(v_{i+1})=\\bar\\alpha(i))\n\\land\\operatorname{Sat}(\\varphi,s)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{28mm}\\land\\forall z\\in M\\;\\forall t\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Assign}(\\mathfrak M,t)\\land t(v_0)=z\n\\land\\forall i\\in n\\;(t(v_{i+1})=\\bar\\alpha(i))\n\\land\\operatorname{Sat}(\\varphi,t)\\to z=y\\Bigr)\\Bigr)\\Biggr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The HOD predicate is relativized explicitly to the transitive model <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span>; no nonexistent superscripted predicate <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HODSet}_S^M\">\\(\\mathrm{HODSet}_S^M\\)</span> is assumed.</li>\n<li>Formula parameters are supplied by genuine assignments to the selected satisfaction recursion; the previous tuple-substitution notation had no registered semantics.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch10/58-df-zfc-inner2-transitive-model.md","status":"resolved","id":"b8a669eb1f18f3f5","anchor":"ref-2","target